---
<main>

<section class="page-hero page-hero--mint" id="overview">
  <div class="wrap page-hero__grid">
    <div class="page-hero__copy reveal">
      <span class="ey">FAQ</span>
      <h1>Questions we expect suppliers to ask.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Short answers to the most common PunchOut Central, pricing, Shopify and procurement questions.</p>
      <div class="page-hero__actions">
        <a class="btn pri" href="/book-demo/">Book a demo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn secbtn" href="#faq">Read answers <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="page-proofline">
        <span><b>✓</b> Free Integration</span>
        <span><b>✓</b> Cancel anytime</span>
        <span><b>✓</b> No transaction fees</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="hero-visual reveal">
      <div class="hero-visual__label"><span>PunchOut Central</span><b>Connected</b></div>
      <div class="visual-flow"><div class="visual-step is-accent"><i>01</i><span><strong>PunchOut</strong><small>How does it work?</small></span><em>Answer</em></div><div class="visual-step is-lavender"><i>02</i><span><strong>Pricing</strong><small>What does it cost?</small></span><em>Answer</em></div><div class="visual-step is-peach"><i>03</i><span><strong>Shopify</strong><small>Can we keep our store?</small></span><em>Answer</em></div><div class="visual-step is-lime"><i>04</i><span><strong>Support</strong><small>Who gets us live?</small></span><em>Answer</em></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trust-strip" aria-label="PunchOut Central credibility">
  <div class="wrap trust-strip__inner">
    <div class="trust-strip__item"><span class="trust-strip__icon">★</span><div><strong>Trustpilot 4.7+</strong><span>Customer rating</span></div></div>
    <span class="trust-strip__divider"></span>
    <div class="trust-strip__item"><span class="trust-strip__icon">PPAI</span><div><strong>PPAI Member</strong><span>Promotional products industry</span></div></div>
    <span class="trust-strip__divider"></span>
    <div class="trust-strip__item"><span class="trust-strip__icon">S</span><div><strong>Shopify Partner</strong><span>Commerce experience</span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="sec soft" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head center reveal"><span class="ey">FAQ</span><h2>PunchOut Central FAQ</h2></div>
    <div class="faq reveal"><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>What is PunchOut Central?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>A managed platform between enterprise procurement and ecommerce. It handles buyer connections, PunchOut sessions, cart return, POs, ecommerce orders, invoices and transaction visibility.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Does PunchOut Central work with Shopify?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>Yes. Shopify is the current production commerce connector.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Do you support cXML and OCI?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>Yes. Both are implemented.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>When is the Shopify order created?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>After the approved PO is received, not at cart return.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Do you charge setup fees?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>The current offer positions standard supported integration as free.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Do you charge transaction fees?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>No.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Can we cancel anytime?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>Launch is positioned as cancel anytime.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>How much does Launch cost?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>$500/month for one enterprise buyer connection, with additional Launch connections at +$300/month.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>How many buyer connections are in Growth?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>Up to 8 enterprise buyer connections in the current pricing direction.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Can we manage multiple stores?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>Yes. Multi-store and multi-buyer management are part of PunchOut Central.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>Is ASN available?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>ASN is not part of the currently implemented capability described for PunchOut Central and is planned for a later phase.</p></div></div><div class="fi"><button class="fq" type="button"><span>What counts as a custom integration?</span><span class="plus">+</span></button><div class="fa"><p>If the requirement needs customer-specific code, unsupported protocols, complex business logic or custom middleware, it should be scoped as professional services.</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="page-cta">
  <div class="wrap reveal">
    <span class="ey">A bigger opportunity is waiting</span>
    <h2>When the buyer asks for PunchOut, say yes.</h2>
    <p class="lead">Start with your first enterprise buyer and grow from there.</p>
    <div class="page-hero__actions">
      <a class="btn pri" href="https://app.punchoutcentral.com/platform/register" target="_blank">Connect my first buyer →</a>
      <a class="btn secbtn" href="/pricing/">See pricing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
